1
00:00:00,052 --> 00:00:01,422
I’m here just to take my man back.

2
00:00:01,756 --> 00:00:02,988
I don’t want to pick a fight.

3
00:00:03,239 --> 00:00:04,600
Are you accepting me into your gang?

4
00:00:04,679 --> 00:00:06,091
You told him
you came to take your man back.

5
00:00:06,215 --> 00:00:07,880
Doesn’t it mean that I’m your henchman?

6
00:00:08,170 --> 00:00:10,960
When I said my man,
I didn’t mean that you were my henchman.

7
00:00:11,489 --> 00:00:13,320
Does anyone want to play chess
against Zeng?

8
00:00:14,926 --> 00:00:15,718
Check.

9
00:00:16,528 --> 00:00:17,840
I’m here to admit that I lost.

10
00:00:18,046 --> 00:00:18,774
Forget it.

11
00:00:18,854 --> 00:00:19,680
It’s just the past.

12
00:00:19,768 --> 00:00:21,192
I have my pride.

13
00:00:21,794 --> 00:00:22,880
I gave you my word.

14
00:00:23,219 --> 00:00:24,215
I won’t change it.

15
00:00:25,040 --> 00:00:27,520
Ah-woo.

16
00:00:51,678 --> 00:00:52,678
Dad.

17
00:00:54,968 --> 00:00:56,680
Can you tell Yong to come home?

18
00:01:01,329 --> 00:01:02,680
I’m worried about him.

19
00:01:16,415 --> 00:01:18,435
Who’s that? Hey, Stop!

20
00:01:21,807 --> 00:01:22,698
Hey.

21
00:01:23,210 --> 00:01:23,976
Stop.

22
00:01:24,001 --> 00:01:24,751
Stop.

23
00:01:31,146 --> 00:01:32,146
Catch them.

24
00:01:34,110 --> 00:01:34,920
Run!

25
00:02:10,596 --> 00:02:11,480
Zeng!

26
00:02:42,540 --> 00:02:43,572
Who do you run with?

27
00:02:44,013 --> 00:02:45,009
I won’t tell you.

28
00:02:45,181 --> 00:02:46,800
-I’m asking you, who do you run with?
-Let me go.

29
00:03:24,804 --> 00:03:29,043
(Next time, I’ll rip your teeth out.
Tot, you pathetic loser.)

30
00:03:29,700 --> 00:03:30,700
Dumbass!

31
00:04:45,240 --> 00:04:46,188
HONGSEN GARAGE

32
00:04:46,217 --> 00:04:47,680
Forty-three.

33
00:04:52,111 --> 00:04:52,920
Check.

34
00:04:56,787 --> 00:04:57,787
Damn it.

35
00:04:57,892 --> 00:04:58,752
You lost again.

36
00:04:58,919 --> 00:04:59,910
Want to play another game?

37
00:05:00,720 --> 00:05:01,670
What about you, Aod?

38
00:05:01,695 --> 00:05:02,483
No.

39
00:05:02,593 --> 00:05:03,400
Sen.

40
00:05:03,449 --> 00:05:04,556
Do you want to play a game with me?

41
00:05:06,984 --> 00:05:07,984
Can I?

42
00:05:08,361 --> 00:05:10,000
Can I play a game with you?

43
00:05:10,361 --> 00:05:12,928
Yeah. You should play with him.

44
00:05:12,953 --> 00:05:13,953
Come on.

45
00:05:23,688 --> 00:05:24,688
Blackjack.

46
00:05:25,150 --> 00:05:26,240
I won.

47
00:05:26,741 --> 00:05:30,000
Come on. Give me the money.

48
00:05:30,053 --> 00:05:31,440
I got a face card. Damn it.

49
00:05:31,591 --> 00:05:32,324
Next hand.

50
00:05:32,349 --> 00:05:33,856
Here’s your nuts.

51
00:05:36,937 --> 00:05:38,280
I’m craving snacks to eat.

52
00:05:38,305 --> 00:05:39,104
Here, Ton.

53
00:05:39,143 --> 00:05:40,060
Here, Piak.

54
00:05:40,116 --> 00:05:41,500
Den, these are your watermelon seeds.

55
00:05:46,355 --> 00:05:47,399
I’m going to practice shooting.

56
00:05:47,605 --> 00:05:49,440
Kla and Aod, if you want to join me, come.

57
00:06:17,818 --> 00:06:19,480
If you can’t handle it, you should go home.

58
00:06:23,104 --> 00:06:24,200
I can handle everything.

59
00:06:26,605 --> 00:06:28,163
It’s just a bit harder with Den.

60
00:06:28,188 --> 00:06:29,600
It means you can’t handle him.

61
00:06:33,768 --> 00:06:34,960
Who said I can’t do it?

62
00:06:35,985 --> 00:06:37,240
Don’t assume things.

63
00:06:38,019 --> 00:06:39,019
Do I?

64
00:06:40,002 --> 00:06:42,480
I’ll earn Den’s acceptance.

65
00:06:43,229 --> 00:06:44,229
How?

66
00:06:45,487 --> 00:06:46,838
I don’t know yet. But I know I can do it.

67
00:06:51,001 --> 00:06:52,500
For the bus fare back to Phra Nakorn.

68
00:06:55,181 --> 00:06:56,400
I told you I won’t go back.

69
00:06:59,116 --> 00:07:01,680
When you want to go back, just tell me.

70
00:07:03,107 --> 00:07:04,328
I’ll give you the bus fare.

71
00:07:08,193 --> 00:07:09,193
Sen.

72
00:07:11,510 --> 00:07:12,760
You want me to go back.

73
00:07:13,699 --> 00:07:15,304
Because you don’t want to help me
with my mom, right?

74
00:07:16,779 --> 00:07:18,480
If you can’t keep your word,

75
00:07:19,662 --> 00:07:20,854
don’t make up an excuse.

76
00:07:23,223 --> 00:07:25,600
When you can make everyone in the gang
accept you,

77
00:07:26,123 --> 00:07:27,721
then you can talk to me about promises.

78
00:07:52,542 --> 00:07:53,542
Den.

79
00:07:54,816 --> 00:07:55,816
Den.

80
00:07:59,039 --> 00:08:00,640
Why do you hate me? Just tell me.

81
00:08:00,770 --> 00:08:03,342
Everyone accepts me into the gang,
except you.

82
00:08:03,367 --> 00:08:04,396
What is your problem?

83
00:08:07,697 --> 00:08:08,960
I don’t hate you.

84
00:08:11,134 --> 00:08:13,040
What do you have to earn my acceptance?

85
00:08:16,024 --> 00:08:17,120
What do you want me to do?

86
00:08:17,466 --> 00:08:18,466
Tell me.

87
00:08:23,384 --> 00:08:25,200
Compete against me in a shooting match.

88
00:08:26,601 --> 00:08:29,160
If you win, I’ll accept you.

89
00:08:38,742 --> 00:08:39,956
If you fail to hit the target,

90
00:08:41,840 --> 00:08:43,080
you must leave the gang.

91
00:08:49,869 --> 00:08:50,869
Fine.

92
00:08:51,499 --> 00:08:52,640
Just set the date.

93
00:09:13,859 --> 00:09:14,859
Din.

94
00:09:15,072 --> 00:09:16,510
Did Ton find a new man to help us?

95
00:09:16,604 --> 00:09:17,880
We won’t finish it before the ship arrives.

96
00:09:18,505 --> 00:09:20,040
Ton joined Tot’s gang.

97
00:09:21,803 --> 00:09:22,560
Hurry up.

98
00:09:22,577 --> 00:09:23,560
What about Keng?

99
00:09:23,647 --> 00:09:25,160
Where is he? Go get him.

100
00:09:25,872 --> 00:09:27,449
Keng left with Ton.

101
00:09:28,650 --> 00:09:29,693
What did you say?

102
00:09:30,026 --> 00:09:32,000
Keng and Ton joined Tot’s gang.

103
00:09:33,093 --> 00:09:34,093
Hurry up.

104
00:09:47,019 --> 00:09:48,139
F*ck you, Tot!

105
00:09:48,548 --> 00:09:49,640
He’s a douchebag.

106
00:09:49,768 --> 00:09:50,558
Asshole.

107
00:09:50,590 --> 00:09:51,720
Bastard.

108
00:09:52,769 --> 00:09:53,769
Dickhead.

109
00:09:54,743 --> 00:09:55,783
That’s right.

110
00:09:56,294 --> 00:09:58,000
Tot is always provoking us.

111
00:09:58,049 --> 00:09:59,640
We need to teach him a lesson.

112
00:09:59,737 --> 00:10:02,634
Yes, if we don’t do anything,
people will say that our gang is a loser.

113
00:10:02,719 --> 00:10:04,160
We need to beat him up.

114
00:10:05,683 --> 00:10:07,520
I will make him pay for it.

115
00:10:07,956 --> 00:10:10,000
But right now,
we need to solve the problem first.

116
00:10:10,419 --> 00:10:11,680
A big ship is coming in.

117
00:10:12,028 --> 00:10:14,883
If we can’t load the cargo onto the ship
in time, everyone will take a hit.

118
00:10:15,059 --> 00:10:17,560
I agree.
Your responsibility should come first.

119
00:10:19,116 --> 00:10:19,949
It’s none of your f*cking business.

120
00:10:20,000 --> 00:10:21,360
Are you messing with my boss?

121
00:10:22,047 --> 00:10:23,047
Din, Kheow.

122
00:10:24,059 --> 00:10:25,059
Sit down.

123
00:10:26,203 --> 00:10:27,524
Don’t pay attention to the temple boy.

124
00:10:34,210 --> 00:10:37,360
You two, go spread the word.

125
00:10:38,033 --> 00:10:42,240
Zeng Klookfoon Gang
is recruiting new members.

126
00:10:42,678 --> 00:10:47,240
I’m looking for capable men to work for me.

127
00:10:47,819 --> 00:10:48,819
Go.

128
00:10:49,142 --> 00:10:50,560
Yes, boss.

129
00:10:53,454 --> 00:10:54,454
Go.

130
00:10:55,026 --> 00:10:55,732
Let’s go.

131
00:10:55,757 --> 00:10:56,480
Go.

132
00:10:56,581 --> 00:10:57,400
Come on.

133
00:11:03,254 --> 00:11:04,360
What the hell are you looking at?

134
00:11:06,027 --> 00:11:08,080
Nothing.

135
00:11:29,395 --> 00:11:30,395
Sen.

136
00:11:33,341 --> 00:11:34,341
Sen.

137
00:11:37,714 --> 00:11:38,831
What do you want?

138
00:11:38,970 --> 00:11:40,410
Den challenges me to a shooting match.

139
00:11:41,038 --> 00:11:43,280
Kla told me that
only you and Den have a gun.

140
00:11:44,582 --> 00:11:45,810
Can I borrow your gun to practice?

141
00:11:47,333 --> 00:11:48,326
You will waste my bullets.

142
00:11:48,404 --> 00:11:50,084
Are you undermining me?

143
00:11:50,747 --> 00:11:52,800
Won’t you give me a chance to prove myself?

144
00:11:58,166 --> 00:11:59,227
You can never beat him.

145
00:11:59,344 --> 00:12:00,400
Don’t underestimate me.

146
00:12:01,119 --> 00:12:03,240
If I practice hard, I’m sure I can beat him.

147
00:12:05,195 --> 00:12:06,195
You?

148
00:12:08,213 --> 00:12:09,360
Just wait and see.

149
00:12:09,622 --> 00:12:11,280
I’ll show you that I can beat Den.

150
00:12:11,523 --> 00:12:12,520
Let me borrow it.

151
00:12:14,913 --> 00:12:16,240
I threw it away a long time ago.

152
00:13:06,961 --> 00:13:08,360
Great.

153
00:13:10,442 --> 00:13:11,640
You slipped up, Sen.

154
00:13:13,870 --> 00:13:14,870
Amazing.

155
00:13:18,461 --> 00:13:19,960
Didn’t you say you threw it away?

156
00:13:22,121 --> 00:13:23,480
Did you go into my room?

157
00:13:24,470 --> 00:13:25,800
If I’m going to lose to Den,

158
00:13:26,764 --> 00:13:28,440
at least I want to do my best.

159
00:13:28,718 --> 00:13:29,600
Yong!

160
00:13:29,757 --> 00:13:30,757
Hey.

161
00:13:56,853 --> 00:13:58,208
If you can reassemble it,

162
00:13:59,330 --> 00:14:00,320
you can take it.

163
00:14:01,360 --> 00:14:03,120
I will also teach you how to shoot.

164
00:14:18,843 --> 00:14:19,883
Hit it, boss.

165
00:14:33,171 --> 00:14:34,171
Done.

166
00:14:38,314 --> 00:14:40,560
You shouldn’t underestimate anyone
you don’t know well.

167
00:15:05,067 --> 00:15:06,880
Are you feeling tired?

168
00:15:07,078 --> 00:15:08,078
Yes.

169
00:15:12,584 --> 00:15:13,468
But I’m feeling much better.

170
00:15:13,613 --> 00:15:15,560
Because you met me?

171
00:15:22,743 --> 00:15:23,960
Is that your friend?

172
00:15:26,173 --> 00:15:30,440
Do you think I would hang out with him?

173
00:15:32,063 --> 00:15:33,320
Oh, come on.

174
00:15:35,602 --> 00:15:36,602
Let’s drink.

175
00:15:36,742 --> 00:15:37,480
Yes.

176
00:15:37,505 --> 00:15:38,505
Hey.

177
00:15:39,232 --> 00:15:40,232
What’s up?

178
00:15:41,569 --> 00:15:43,000
Why do I always run into you?

179
00:15:43,133 --> 00:15:44,133
Maybe…

180
00:15:45,213 --> 00:15:46,573
it’s our destiny.

181
00:15:47,477 --> 00:15:48,320
Ptuh!

182
00:15:48,454 --> 00:15:49,560
It’s more like a curse.

183
00:15:54,108 --> 00:15:55,360
What are you looking at?

184
00:15:57,256 --> 00:16:00,960
Can anyone ever take their eyes off you?

185
00:16:01,530 --> 00:16:04,400
Then keep looking at me.
Don’t take your eyes off me.

186
00:16:04,948 --> 00:16:07,760
Sure, I will look only at you tonight.

187
00:16:10,978 --> 00:16:12,360
This is my first time at the bar.

188
00:16:13,000 --> 00:16:15,560
Don’t forget to ask for me next time.

189
00:16:15,775 --> 00:16:16,609
Sure.

190
00:16:46,666 --> 00:16:49,280
If I can’t have her, you won’t get her either.

191
00:16:51,148 --> 00:16:52,148
Come here.

192
00:16:57,844 --> 00:16:58,889
Are you daring me?

193
00:17:01,536 --> 00:17:02,576
Hey, asshole.

194
00:17:08,686 --> 00:17:09,686
Hey.

195
00:17:11,878 --> 00:17:13,080
You think you’re so tough?

196
00:17:13,630 --> 00:17:15,680
I’m tougher than you.

197
00:17:16,320 --> 00:17:18,120
Ouch, ouch.

198
00:17:20,494 --> 00:17:21,640
Do you want to try me?

199
00:17:23,619 --> 00:17:24,619
Bring it on.

200
00:18:17,443 --> 00:18:19,480
Drink it, drink it.

201
00:18:24,410 --> 00:18:26,229
-Bottoms up, bottoms up!
-Bottoms up, bottoms up!

202
00:18:31,097 --> 00:18:32,320
You’re such a wimp.

203
00:18:33,547 --> 00:18:34,480
Are you sure?

204
00:18:35,529 --> 00:18:36,440
Give it to me.

205
00:18:41,214 --> 00:18:44,440
Drink it, drink it, drink it.

206
00:18:53,723 --> 00:18:55,240
Can’t keep up, loser?

207
00:19:00,830 --> 00:19:02,646
No, you are a loser, asshole.

208
00:19:06,057 --> 00:19:07,080
You are two shots behind me.

209
00:19:07,781 --> 00:19:08,691
I’m keeping track of it.

210
00:19:08,713 --> 00:19:10,120
What the f*ck!

211
00:19:11,393 --> 00:19:12,656
Why did you hit me?

212
00:19:12,817 --> 00:19:13,817
Huh?

213
00:19:16,400 --> 00:19:18,400
Here. Hit me here too.

214
00:19:20,200 --> 00:19:22,760
Good. Now, it’s balanced.

215
00:19:23,353 --> 00:19:24,473
Give it to me.

216
00:19:24,573 --> 00:19:25,366
Hey.

217
00:19:25,391 --> 00:19:26,391
What?

218
00:19:27,048 --> 00:19:28,048
It’s mine.

219
00:19:29,780 --> 00:19:31,758
You said I’m two shots behind you.

220
00:19:32,187 --> 00:19:35,141
Don’t act like that jerk, Tot—that thief.

221
00:19:41,643 --> 00:19:42,593
I’m not a thief.

222
00:19:42,618 --> 00:19:43,898
You are a thief.

223
00:19:44,394 --> 00:19:48,120
Go. Join Tot and Damding Gang.

224
00:19:48,797 --> 00:19:50,080
You’re good at stealing.

225
00:19:50,254 --> 00:19:53,367
You stole my stuff, my men,

226
00:19:53,864 --> 00:19:55,400
and now my booze.

227
00:19:55,573 --> 00:19:56,800
It’s because you are a wimp.

228
00:19:57,393 --> 00:19:59,160
Instead of throwing a tantrum here,

229
00:19:59,530 --> 00:20:02,240
if I were you,
I would go there and beat him up.

230
00:20:02,443 --> 00:20:04,903
Don’t dare me.
Do you think I won’t do it?

231
00:20:06,588 --> 00:20:07,588
Do you dare do it?

232
00:20:07,644 --> 00:20:08,644
Yes.

233
00:20:09,787 --> 00:20:11,800
If you dare, then let’s go.

234
00:20:11,852 --> 00:20:13,800
Yes, I will go.

235
00:20:14,132 --> 00:20:14,932
-Go.
-Let’s go.

236
00:20:15,013 --> 00:20:15,615
Go.

237
00:20:15,640 --> 00:20:19,000
I’ll show you that
Zeng Klookfoon is not a wimp.

238
00:20:19,212 --> 00:20:19,960
Let’s go.

239
00:20:21,728 --> 00:20:23,040
Walk forward.

240
00:20:24,667 --> 00:20:26,200
Why is the door so far?

241
00:20:26,594 --> 00:20:27,594
Ouch.

242
00:20:29,358 --> 00:20:30,358
Calm down.

243
00:20:30,673 --> 00:20:32,200
Let’s deal with the boss.

244
00:20:32,422 --> 00:20:34,928
Let’s go beat Tot. Go!

245
00:20:48,993 --> 00:20:50,793
You betrayed your own boss.

246
00:20:50,879 --> 00:20:52,040
You are worse than a dog.

247
00:20:54,014 --> 00:20:55,360
You’re like a vagrant dog.

248
00:20:57,786 --> 00:20:59,640
Why would I want to keep you?

249
00:21:00,110 --> 00:21:01,440
I will never betray you.

250
00:21:03,677 --> 00:21:04,792
How can I trust you?

251
00:21:04,817 --> 00:21:05,670
Please don’t kill me.

252
00:21:05,695 --> 00:21:06,695
Hey.

253
00:21:11,959 --> 00:21:13,000
Who the hell are you?

254
00:21:13,309 --> 00:21:14,509
I’m your daddy.

255
00:21:28,610 --> 00:21:30,960
Calm down.

256
00:21:32,123 --> 00:21:33,200
Do you want to get killed?

257
00:21:37,229 --> 00:21:39,120
I’ll pee on you all.

258
00:21:40,243 --> 00:21:41,243
Asshole!

259
00:22:22,182 --> 00:22:23,360
The cop is here.

260
00:22:23,793 --> 00:22:24,812
Who called them?

261
00:22:24,837 --> 00:22:25,837
I did.

262
00:22:35,609 --> 00:22:36,411
Zoe.

263
00:22:41,591 --> 00:22:43,000
Come on. Let’s go.

264
00:22:47,588 --> 00:22:48,960
This felt so damn good.

265
00:22:49,002 --> 00:22:51,485
You’re a bastard. You really peed on him.

266
00:22:51,600 --> 00:22:52,840
You’re a bastard.

267
00:22:53,222 --> 00:22:54,262
You, jackass.

268
00:22:55,763 --> 00:22:56,680
You, scumbag.

269
00:22:58,478 --> 00:22:59,400
Zoe!

270
00:23:10,299 --> 00:23:11,320
What water is this?

271
00:23:13,303 --> 00:23:14,160
Hey.

272
00:23:22,648 --> 00:23:23,995
Zoe, wake up.

273
00:23:25,536 --> 00:23:26,536
What?

274
00:23:33,241 --> 00:23:35,200
Zeng. You should leave.

275
00:23:54,133 --> 00:23:55,133
Your turn.

276
00:23:55,480 --> 00:23:56,600
What’s your name?

277
00:23:57,283 --> 00:23:58,283
Wan Jiap.

278
00:23:58,390 --> 00:23:59,390
Go.

279
00:24:02,834 --> 00:24:05,640
Hey, Zeng.
Why are you so late?

280
00:24:07,680 --> 00:24:10,080
Hello, Zeng.

281
00:24:12,818 --> 00:24:14,240
Where have you been all night?

282
00:24:14,937 --> 00:24:16,240
Did you have a great time?

283
00:24:17,637 --> 00:24:20,000
Kind of.

284
00:24:21,658 --> 00:24:24,400
What are these men doing here?

285
00:24:24,518 --> 00:24:25,518
What?

286
00:24:26,139 --> 00:24:28,360
You said you’re recruiting new members.

287
00:24:28,793 --> 00:24:30,120
They are here for that.

288
00:24:31,962 --> 00:24:33,760
Everyone wants to work for you.

289
00:24:34,879 --> 00:24:36,618
Look.

290
00:24:38,040 --> 00:24:39,820
The last one, Chui.

291
00:24:42,250 --> 00:24:43,498
-Are you Chui?
-Yes.

292
00:24:43,589 --> 00:24:44,459
How old are you?

293
00:24:44,484 --> 00:24:45,484
29.

294
00:24:45,823 --> 00:24:46,853
Are you unemployed?

295
00:24:47,777 --> 00:24:48,777
Go, go.

296
00:24:48,803 --> 00:24:50,000
Is this the last one?

297
00:24:50,674 --> 00:24:52,000
Get ready.

298
00:24:52,130 --> 00:24:53,200
The evaluation will begin soon.

299
00:24:59,446 --> 00:25:00,446
Wait.

300
00:25:01,844 --> 00:25:02,844
Wait for me.

301
00:25:05,398 --> 00:25:06,563
What the hell are you doing here?

302
00:25:08,214 --> 00:25:09,880
Go away. We are closed.

303
00:25:12,083 --> 00:25:13,400
You can close the application.

304
00:25:13,752 --> 00:25:15,000
I already applied.

305
00:25:15,958 --> 00:25:16,958
When?

306
00:25:23,004 --> 00:25:29,560
I, Zeng Klookfoon,
accepted Zoe Temple Boy’s application.

307
00:25:32,770 --> 00:25:33,770
What?

308
00:25:34,122 --> 00:25:35,960
Don’t you remember last night?

309
00:25:50,481 --> 00:25:53,120
Zeng, I’m sorry.

310
00:25:53,900 --> 00:25:55,760
I crashed your bike.

311
00:25:56,669 --> 00:25:59,520
Your riding skills suck.

312
00:25:59,887 --> 00:26:01,000
Forget it.

313
00:26:02,098 --> 00:26:03,617
I’ve got to go.

314
00:26:03,679 --> 00:26:05,677
Wait. Stay with me.

315
00:26:05,702 --> 00:26:07,120
I can’t be late.

316
00:26:07,497 --> 00:26:09,177
I’m the gang’s leader.

317
00:26:09,202 --> 00:26:10,200
You are breaking my neck.

318
00:26:10,347 --> 00:26:15,206
I, Zeng Klookfoon, accept, Zoe…

319
00:26:17,006 --> 00:26:19,400
Zoe Temple Boy’s application.

320
00:26:21,169 --> 00:26:22,080
My words are sacred.

321
00:26:22,552 --> 00:26:23,880
There’s only paper here.

322
00:26:24,674 --> 00:26:26,240
Where can I find a pencil?

323
00:26:26,451 --> 00:26:27,480
Is there one here?

324
00:26:28,004 --> 00:26:29,004
I have it.

325
00:26:29,897 --> 00:26:31,017
You are weird.

326
00:26:31,516 --> 00:26:34,400
I accept Zoe Temple Boy…

327
00:26:41,803 --> 00:26:43,560
Damn it.

328
00:26:55,548 --> 00:26:56,548
Here.

329
00:27:01,498 --> 00:27:04,160
When you point the gun,
keep your finger off the trigger.

330
00:27:05,013 --> 00:27:06,177
Yong, your finger.

331
00:27:06,202 --> 00:27:07,202
I forgot.

332
00:27:08,099 --> 00:27:09,920
Hold it with both hands.

333
00:27:10,131 --> 00:27:10,960
Yeah.

334
00:27:11,583 --> 00:27:12,837
Why are your legs so close together?

335
00:27:13,122 --> 00:27:14,160
Are you afraid that your balls will fall?

336
00:27:14,226 --> 00:27:15,029
Spread them apart.

337
00:27:15,054 --> 00:27:16,028
Just a little.

338
00:27:17,836 --> 00:27:18,914
Your shoulders are not straight.

339
00:27:18,939 --> 00:27:19,826
Keep them straight.

340
00:27:20,625 --> 00:27:22,640
Keep the front and rear sights aligned.

341
00:27:22,731 --> 00:27:23,560
Look straight.

342
00:27:23,601 --> 00:27:24,801
Open your eyes.

343
00:27:25,303 --> 00:27:26,303
Aim.

344
00:27:33,089 --> 00:27:34,040
What are you looking at?

345
00:27:34,353 --> 00:27:35,398
Look at the target.

346
00:27:39,958 --> 00:27:42,600
Wow, amazing.

347
00:28:45,711 --> 00:28:46,711
Don’t worry.

348
00:28:47,596 --> 00:28:50,240
You missed the target
because your left arm was not straight.

349
00:28:50,949 --> 00:28:53,080
You need to keep both arms straight.

350
00:28:54,304 --> 00:28:56,440
Keep the front and rear sights aligned.

351
00:29:17,139 --> 00:29:18,400
Yong!

352
00:29:20,451 --> 00:29:21,760
Where is your focus?

353
00:29:22,664 --> 00:29:24,206
What would you do if it hit someone?

354
00:29:27,006 --> 00:29:28,006
I’m sorry.

355
00:29:34,682 --> 00:29:36,040
I’m so aching.

356
00:29:40,071 --> 00:29:41,480
You know how to assemble a gun.

357
00:29:42,360 --> 00:29:43,760
Why don’t you know how to shoot?

358
00:29:46,359 --> 00:29:48,160
I often watched my dad do it.

359
00:29:48,419 --> 00:29:50,000
So I followed what he did.

360
00:29:52,023 --> 00:29:53,680
It’s just technical skills.

361
00:29:54,484 --> 00:29:56,280
It’s different from shooting someone.

362
00:30:00,250 --> 00:30:03,520
You are surely a rich kid,
not a gangster, Yong.

363
00:30:08,677 --> 00:30:10,320
You are a real gangster.

364
00:30:11,382 --> 00:30:12,710
Have you shot many people?

365
00:30:17,904 --> 00:30:19,480
Why did you hide your gun?

366
00:30:21,890 --> 00:30:23,520
Why did you tell me you threw it away?

367
00:30:47,205 --> 00:30:51,280
Now you know how to use a gun.
You should use it well.

368
00:30:52,086 --> 00:30:53,440
Don’t shoot anyone.

369
00:30:55,619 --> 00:30:57,160
I won’t shoot anyone.

370
00:30:58,182 --> 00:31:00,080
I just want Den to accept me.

371
00:31:01,045 --> 00:31:02,600
So I can stay here without worries.

372
00:31:20,295 --> 00:31:21,295
Why?

373
00:31:23,739 --> 00:31:24,739
It stinks.

374
00:31:25,717 --> 00:31:26,717
It stinks?

375
00:31:30,208 --> 00:31:33,000
If you want to work for me,
you need to endure it.

376
00:31:35,293 --> 00:31:36,293
Let me go.

377
00:31:37,580 --> 00:31:39,713
You are surely a rich kid, Yong.

378
00:32:33,332 --> 00:32:34,332
Yes, boss.

379
00:32:36,987 --> 00:32:38,187
Spread my legs?

380
00:32:40,307 --> 00:32:41,720
The front and rear sights.

381
00:32:43,670 --> 00:32:44,670
-Yes.
-Hey.

382
00:32:50,764 --> 00:32:52,120
I am spreading my legs.

383
00:32:54,402 --> 00:32:55,402
I’m sorry.

384
00:32:56,164 --> 00:32:57,164
Yong.

385
00:32:58,555 --> 00:32:59,555
Hey.

386
00:33:17,864 --> 00:33:19,544
Can’t I rest a little?

387
00:33:24,382 --> 00:33:26,062
The last match for today.

388
00:33:27,146 --> 00:33:28,346
Zoe Temple Boy…

389
00:33:32,422 --> 00:33:35,400
…versus Yak!

390
00:34:20,063 --> 00:34:21,343
Can’t handle it?

391
00:34:48,326 --> 00:34:49,520
That’s all you got.

392
00:35:04,373 --> 00:35:07,717
Yak, Yak, Yak, Yak.

393
00:35:30,999 --> 00:35:31,999
Yak.

394
00:35:32,620 --> 00:35:33,640
Hit him in the head.

395
00:35:41,739 --> 00:35:43,520
Come on. Get up.

396
00:35:59,320 --> 00:36:03,600
Zoe, Zoe, Zoe, Zoe.

397
00:36:22,320 --> 00:36:25,104
The members of Zeng Klookfoon
are not afraid to die.

398
00:36:25,623 --> 00:36:27,303
The five of you, pair up.

399
00:36:28,300 --> 00:36:29,300
Come on.

400
00:36:35,361 --> 00:36:38,240
Russian Roulette, you know it, right?

401
00:36:38,867 --> 00:36:41,440
Five chances of survival,
one chance of death.

402
00:36:41,905 --> 00:36:45,200
The last man standing will join our gang.

403
00:36:49,508 --> 00:36:50,680
There’s one bullet.

404
00:36:52,907 --> 00:36:55,480
If you are scared, you can step out now.

405
00:36:58,534 --> 00:36:59,574
They pair up.

406
00:37:00,474 --> 00:37:01,720
These two pair up.

407
00:37:04,002 --> 00:37:05,122
What about me?

408
00:37:05,524 --> 00:37:06,640
Who will be my partner?

409
00:37:17,274 --> 00:37:18,760
Will Zeng be my partner?

410
00:37:21,872 --> 00:37:23,312
Since I might die,

411
00:37:25,179 --> 00:37:27,240
I want to die in front of Zeng Klookfoon.

412
00:37:28,312 --> 00:37:30,040
It would be my honor.

413
00:37:31,376 --> 00:37:32,440
Zeng is not a part of the game.

414
00:37:34,201 --> 00:37:35,240
You can’t ask him that.

415
00:37:37,778 --> 00:37:38,778
Zeng.

416
00:37:40,133 --> 00:37:41,040
Are you scared?

417
00:38:03,240 --> 00:38:05,973
If you want to face me, then bring it on.

418
00:38:14,478 --> 00:38:15,920
I’ll let you shoot first.

419
00:38:16,948 --> 00:38:19,560
If you hit the target, I’ll accept you.

420
00:38:20,327 --> 00:38:22,840
If you miss, you will have to leave.

421
00:38:23,257 --> 00:38:26,080
Your target is this watermelon seed.

422
00:38:31,132 --> 00:38:32,160
You have only one chance.

423
00:39:01,760 --> 00:39:02,760
Focus.

424
00:39:04,571 --> 00:39:05,611
Stand steady.

425
00:39:08,769 --> 00:39:09,769
Wait.

426
00:39:14,067 --> 00:39:15,200
You practiced with my gun.

427
00:39:18,267 --> 00:39:19,440
Use my gun to shoot.

428
00:39:48,288 --> 00:39:49,280
(Don’t be nervous.)

429
00:39:49,634 --> 00:39:50,720
(Focus on the target.)

430
00:39:50,944 --> 00:39:52,360
(Keep the front and rear sights aligned.)

431
00:39:52,463 --> 00:39:53,421
(Keep your arms straight.)

432
00:40:03,980 --> 00:40:05,000
(Don’t be afraid.)

433
00:40:06,122 --> 00:40:07,160
(Stay focused.)

434
00:40:37,233 --> 00:40:38,694
Hey, Yong.

435
00:40:39,161 --> 00:40:40,357
You miss it.

436
00:40:40,705 --> 00:40:44,801
He misses it. He’s such a loser.

437
00:40:44,880 --> 00:40:45,880
I told you.

438
00:40:46,922 --> 00:40:48,640
He’s a loser.

439
00:41:12,473 --> 00:41:13,673
Good luck, bro.

440
00:41:14,080 --> 00:41:15,120
See you around.

441
00:41:15,404 --> 00:41:16,404
Yes.

442
00:41:17,066 --> 00:41:18,108
Wish you all the best.

443
00:41:19,179 --> 00:41:20,179
Yes.

444
00:41:28,991 --> 00:41:30,360
I’m leaving. Goodbye.

445
00:41:33,300 --> 00:41:35,240
You shouldn’t have wasted your time
teaching him.

446
00:41:36,269 --> 00:41:39,341
Yong is not good enough
to be a part of our gang.

447
00:42:21,513 --> 00:42:23,040
I survive.

448
00:42:23,280 --> 00:42:24,331
You, take it.

449
00:42:24,440 --> 00:42:25,840
It’s your turn. Take it.

450
00:42:28,319 --> 00:42:29,127
I can’t do it.

451
00:42:29,152 --> 00:42:30,053
I’ll quit.

452
00:42:42,683 --> 00:42:44,280
Damn it. I can’t do it.

453
00:42:55,960 --> 00:42:56,960
Don’t.

454
00:43:08,340 --> 00:43:09,340
Good luck.

455
00:43:21,663 --> 00:43:22,680
It’s your turn.

456
00:43:26,931 --> 00:43:28,360
Have a nice trip to the other side.

457
00:43:34,534 --> 00:43:36,840
I like it here.

458
00:43:45,353 --> 00:43:47,164
Do you want me
to book a funeral home for you?

459
00:43:58,100 --> 00:44:00,280
Hey. Stop it.

460
00:44:00,615 --> 00:44:01,840
There are only two shots left.

461
00:44:02,093 --> 00:44:03,773
The chances are 50/50.

462
00:44:07,864 --> 00:44:09,320
Shall we stop, Zeng?

463
00:44:10,196 --> 00:44:11,556
I’ll let you win.

464
00:44:12,243 --> 00:44:13,480
Do you think I’m a wimp?

465
00:44:14,654 --> 00:44:16,120
I’m just worried about you.

466
00:44:18,223 --> 00:44:19,223
Take it.

467
00:44:50,856 --> 00:44:52,040
Why don’t you stop here?

468
00:44:53,150 --> 00:44:54,268
At least, you won’t die.

469
00:44:55,321 --> 00:44:56,480
If I stop,

470
00:44:57,809 --> 00:44:59,240
will you accept me into your gang?

471
00:44:59,589 --> 00:45:02,440
If you die, you can’t join my gang anyway.

472
00:45:03,540 --> 00:45:05,640
Stop it. It doesn’t worth to die for.

473
00:45:20,251 --> 00:45:21,520
You said it yourself.

474
00:45:22,680 --> 00:45:26,040
When you give your word, you won’t change it.

475
00:45:51,048 --> 00:45:52,048
Din! Kheow!

476
00:45:52,539 --> 00:45:53,760
What have you done?

477
00:45:57,196 --> 00:45:58,280
I’m sorry.

478
00:46:11,037 --> 00:46:12,640
You insulted me in front of everyone.

479
00:46:14,590 --> 00:46:16,301
Get up. Now.

480
00:46:20,586 --> 00:46:21,586
I’m sorry.

481
00:46:21,713 --> 00:46:22,960
I took the bullet out.

482
00:46:23,085 --> 00:46:24,205
I ordered him to do it.

483
00:46:24,263 --> 00:46:26,373
You both did wrong.

484
00:46:28,124 --> 00:46:30,680
From now on, how can I trust you?

485
00:46:30,955 --> 00:46:31,817
Huh?

486
00:46:31,919 --> 00:46:32,919
Hey.

487
00:46:33,114 --> 00:46:34,600
They just mean well.

488
00:46:34,944 --> 00:46:36,320
If I were them, I would do the same.

489
00:46:36,501 --> 00:46:37,621
Don’t butt in.

490
00:46:38,717 --> 00:46:43,325
How could they let the gang’s leader
risk his life for some random idiot?

491
00:46:44,128 --> 00:46:46,360
Did you know that the gun was not loaded?

492
00:46:46,757 --> 00:46:47,877
I didn’t know.

493
00:46:48,938 --> 00:46:51,440
But I saw you two acting strange.

494
00:46:52,498 --> 00:46:56,207
So I took my chances and
thought about what I would do if I were them.

495
00:47:00,474 --> 00:47:02,040
Where did you get that confidence?

496
00:47:03,039 --> 00:47:05,920
If you were wrong, you could have died.

497
00:47:06,276 --> 00:47:07,956
Yes, you could have died.

498
00:47:08,127 --> 00:47:10,600
But I’m lucky that I wasn’t wrong.

499
00:47:12,567 --> 00:47:14,634
Damn, you are out of your mind.

500
00:47:15,562 --> 00:47:17,760
I told you. I like this place.

501
00:47:19,587 --> 00:47:21,120
This is the place I want to be.

502
00:47:30,858 --> 00:47:33,135
So…

503
00:47:37,060 --> 00:47:38,280
am I in?

504
00:48:13,677 --> 00:48:14,960
You have no place to go?

505
00:48:18,230 --> 00:48:19,600
You knew that you could never beat me,

506
00:48:19,980 --> 00:48:21,280
but you didn’t give up.

507
00:48:22,216 --> 00:48:23,760
You are so stubborn.

508
00:48:30,483 --> 00:48:31,483
Fine.

509
00:48:32,179 --> 00:48:33,459
I’ll accept you.

510
00:48:36,400 --> 00:48:37,560
Sen, what are you looking at?

511
00:48:42,708 --> 00:48:43,708
Den.

512
00:48:43,877 --> 00:48:45,440
When you first learned to shoot,

513
00:48:46,932 --> 00:48:48,480
did you hit the target as Yong did?

514
00:48:53,319 --> 00:48:55,080
I don’t accept you for your skills,

515
00:48:57,655 --> 00:48:58,952
but I accept you for your spirit.

516
00:49:00,841 --> 00:49:02,041
Do you mean it?

517
00:49:02,910 --> 00:49:03,910
Yes.

518
00:49:04,993 --> 00:49:06,240
Come on. Let’s go back.

519
00:49:08,671 --> 00:49:09,671
Den.

520
00:49:09,881 --> 00:49:10,881
Wait for me.

521
00:49:15,464 --> 00:49:17,440
Last one to finish has to stick
a watermelon seed up their nose!

522
00:49:17,529 --> 00:49:19,520
Yong, you can’t do that.

523
00:49:28,348 --> 00:49:30,778
You can’t beat me in everything, Zoe.

524
00:49:32,338 --> 00:49:33,680
If you keep losing to me,

525
00:49:34,181 --> 00:49:36,048
how would you face your men?

526
00:49:36,980 --> 00:49:37,980
We’ll see.

527
00:49:40,381 --> 00:49:41,381
Hands.

528
00:49:48,060 --> 00:49:49,060
Ready?

529
00:49:49,643 --> 00:49:50,643
Start.

530
00:49:56,107 --> 00:49:57,600
Hey, hey, hey.

531
00:49:57,745 --> 00:49:58,473
Do it.

532
00:49:58,498 --> 00:49:59,840
You can do it.

533
00:50:00,481 --> 00:50:01,481
Go.

534
00:50:02,290 --> 00:50:04,588
Oh, oh, oh.

535
00:50:08,626 --> 00:50:11,351
Oh, oh, oh.

536
00:50:15,456 --> 00:50:17,056
Zeng, you can do it.

537
00:50:18,444 --> 00:50:19,707
Push it down.

538
00:50:19,912 --> 00:50:21,280
Come on.

539
00:50:24,924 --> 00:50:28,200
Oh, oh, oh.

540
00:50:48,152 --> 00:50:49,152
Oh.

541
00:50:54,059 --> 00:50:55,059
Oh.

542
00:50:55,404 --> 00:50:56,667
Zeng, you can do it.

543
00:50:56,692 --> 00:50:58,130
Oh.

544
00:50:58,174 --> 00:50:59,525
Hey, hey, hey.

545
00:51:16,409 --> 00:51:17,680
Will it end today?

546
00:51:18,576 --> 00:51:19,576
No.

547
00:51:45,415 --> 00:51:46,440
Can I sit with you?

548
00:51:53,999 --> 00:51:54,999
Yeah.

549
00:51:58,677 --> 00:51:59,677
Sen, I…

550
00:52:05,219 --> 00:52:07,505
Sen, I don’t want to bother you, but…

551
00:52:10,290 --> 00:52:11,567
I want some peace.

552
00:52:12,178 --> 00:52:15,197
If you want to sit here, can you be quiet?

553
00:52:17,978 --> 00:52:18,978
Yes.

554
00:52:26,317 --> 00:52:27,597
Sen, what about…

555
00:52:46,694 --> 00:52:48,120
-What are you looking at?
-Shh!

556
00:52:48,518 --> 00:52:49,518
Be quiet.

557
00:52:49,566 --> 00:52:51,360
Yong, are you teasing me?

558
00:53:09,852 --> 00:53:12,240
Thank you for helping me.

559
00:53:30,795 --> 00:53:32,720
Play it. I want to hear it.

560
00:54:13,875 --> 00:54:15,320
I really respect you.

561
00:54:17,932 --> 00:54:18,932
Yeah.

562
00:54:19,039 --> 00:54:20,039
Thanks.

563
00:54:23,456 --> 00:54:25,480
I thought you were like the other two-bit thugs.

564
00:54:27,340 --> 00:54:28,600
Now, I get to know you,

565
00:54:30,021 --> 00:54:33,080
you don’t disappoint me, Zeng Klookfoon.

566
00:54:34,291 --> 00:54:35,971
You are the real deal.

567
00:54:39,856 --> 00:54:41,840
Yeah, that’s me.

568
00:54:42,156 --> 00:54:43,240
You just realized it now.

569
00:54:47,001 --> 00:54:48,361
You make me feel…

570
00:54:56,210 --> 00:54:57,210
love.

571
00:54:59,893 --> 00:55:00,893
I love you.

572
00:55:16,532 --> 00:55:17,532
Yes!

573
00:55:19,516 --> 00:55:20,800
I won!

574
00:55:27,203 --> 00:55:30,000
I won, but no one saw it.

575
00:55:31,548 --> 00:55:32,629
I’m going to get some sleep.

576
00:55:32,746 --> 00:55:33,746
Wait.

577
00:55:36,086 --> 00:55:37,086
What?

578
00:55:41,718 --> 00:55:43,000
This is my handkerchief.

579
00:55:43,747 --> 00:55:45,520
It’s a symbol that I accept you.

580
00:55:58,989 --> 00:55:59,989
Hey.

581
00:56:01,672 --> 00:56:03,880
They said that gifting a handkerchief
means we will be parting.

582
00:56:13,470 --> 00:56:15,280
I want to be with you for a long time.

583
00:56:41,731 --> 00:56:42,960
I’ll have ten bags.

584
00:56:43,564 --> 00:56:44,480
It’s sold out.

585
00:56:44,505 --> 00:56:45,505
What?

586
00:56:45,997 --> 00:56:47,760
Hongsen is going to have withdrawals.

587
00:56:48,210 --> 00:56:49,210
Poor him.

588
00:56:57,994 --> 00:56:58,994
Here.

589
00:56:59,971 --> 00:57:01,720
I’ll give you two bags out of kindness.

590
00:57:02,524 --> 00:57:03,724
Here, two bags.

591
00:57:06,863 --> 00:57:07,960
I don’t want them.

592
00:57:08,464 --> 00:57:11,280
My pride as a gangster
is more important than my life.

593
00:57:14,515 --> 00:57:15,640
Then you have to endure the withdrawals.

594
00:57:16,114 --> 00:57:17,114
Fine.

595
00:57:17,329 --> 00:57:18,310
What about your boss?

596
00:57:18,410 --> 00:57:19,690
He will be fine.

597
00:57:22,512 --> 00:57:23,520
He said he didn’t want it.

598
00:57:24,208 --> 00:57:25,800
Pride doesn’t feed you,

599
00:57:27,449 --> 00:57:28,440
but it sure looks cool.

600
00:57:39,234 --> 00:57:41,234
Hong, don’t you have any left?

601
00:57:41,298 --> 00:57:43,640
He agreed to give it to you.
Why didn’t you take it?

602
00:57:45,604 --> 00:57:46,655
It doesn’t look cool.

603
00:57:55,002 --> 00:57:57,480
Yong, I cut Hongsen off a long time ago.

604
00:57:57,579 --> 00:57:58,680
Why do you ask for his help?

605
00:57:58,722 --> 00:58:01,880
But now I want to know
why you and he stopped being friends.

606
00:58:02,683 --> 00:58:04,120
Hongsen killed Dad.

607
00:58:05,992 --> 00:58:07,272
Can I trust you?

608
00:58:08,168 --> 00:58:10,920
If I can trust you,
you can trust me.

609
00:58:12,956 --> 00:58:14,560
Zoe, listen to me.

610
00:58:14,978 --> 00:58:18,600
Even if no one sees your worth,
you still have me.

611
00:58:18,897 --> 00:58:21,440
Since he joined our gang,
he sneaks out every morning.

612
00:58:22,178 --> 00:58:23,686
Did you check his background?

613
00:58:24,673 --> 00:58:25,680
What are you doing?
